# The Minigun's barrel and view model spinning up from rest, first person,
# on this player's own stock Minigun (item 15: this account's Heavy carries
# the Tomislav, 424, swapped by `stock`); real TF2, ours: barrel.scene.
# One tick a frame (host_framerate 0.015; `wait 2` is one frame): attack2
# pressed, pictures 50 ticks (the wind-up's end, the barrel 1.91 rad) and
# 100 ticks (7.58 rad) after it, then attack too, 150 ticks after it
# (spun and firing; specs/tf2/minigun.md 5's table).
#   tools/tf2ref/tf2ref.py scene tools/tf2ref/scenes/barrel.tf2 --out <dir>
mp_disable_respawn_times 1
tf_weapon_criticals 0
cl_drawhud 0
r_drawvgui 0
fov_desired 90
viewmodel_fov 54
mat_colorcorrection 0
jointeam red
joinclass heavyweapons
kill
sleep 7
setpos 0 0 0
setang 0 90 0
use tf_weapon_minigun
stock tf_weapon_minigun 15
sleep 3
shot barrel_idle
host_framerate 0.015
wait 2
+attack2
wait 100
snap barrel_t50
wait 100
snap barrel_t100
+attack
wait 100
snap barrel_t150
-attack
-attack2
wait 2
host_framerate 0
sleep 4
